<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Sept 11.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Sept 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Tilbury Sep 126.00 Oct/Dec 129.00/28.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Oct/Dec 132.00 Apr/Jun 138.00</p>
<p>Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Sep 128.00 Oct/Dec 130.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Avon Sep 106.50 Oct/Dec 109.50 Jan/Mar 112.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Oct/Dec 112.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Sep 106.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Oct/Dec 104.50 Jan/Mar 107.00 Apr/Jun 110.00</p>
<p>Avon Oct/Dec 104.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Sep 100.50</p>
</text>
